window.products.push({"id":663038,"name":"LATEMORNINGS Luxury King Cotton Percale Pillowcases Set of 2 (20x36 inch) - 300 Thread Count - White Body Pillow Cases - King Size, Deep Pocket Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZgbiBAf-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A little bit of luxury every day These percale cotton pillow cases from LateMornings are crafted in Italy from 100% combed cotton. With a luxurious feel that is fitting of a five star hotel, this breathable cotton body pillow case set is like waking up in your own slice of heaven every morning. For the premium cotton bed sheets and pillowcases that you’ve always deserved, treat yourself to this queen set from LateMornings. A perfect night’s sleep We’ve thought of everything. Here’s what makes our body pillow cover set special: Long lasting: this pillowcase set is hotel grade and built to withstand the test of time. Long lasting : this pillowcase set is hotel grade and built to withstand the test of time. No pilling: because we use nothing but pure cotton, these covers will always feel smooth. No pilling : because we use nothing but pure cotton, these covers will always feel smooth. Deep pockets: our body pillow set easily fits a large king size pillows. Deep pockets : our body pillow set easily fits a large king size pillows. Soft: we’ve engineered our percale case set with comfort in mind. Soft : we’ve engineered our percale case set with comfort in mind. Quality: if we wouldn’t sleep in the sheet and pillow set ourselves, we won’t sell it. Quality : if we wouldn’t sleep in the sheet and pillow set ourselves, we won’t sell it. Cool and comfortable Because we use 100% Italian combed percale cotton, this king pillow set will always feel cool, even in warmer climates and hot months. Better yet, our king bed set gets softer and smoother with every wash. Safe for your skin At LateMornings, we never use any questionable anti-wrinkle chemiicals or treatments. Our cotton pillowcase set is Oeko-Tex certified and ideal for people with sensitive skin, easily prone to irritation. Our promise If you don’t love your body pillow covers set, simply let us know what the issue is with your king sheets or pillowcases and we’ll do everything we can to make it right. No fuss, no tricks , no fine print; just incredible customer service from LateMornings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZgbiBAf-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LATEMORNINGS","source_asin":"B088TM4VGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088TM4VGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088TM4VGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
