window.products.push({"id":663047,"name":"Manual Food Processor Vegetable Chopper, Geedel Pull Chopper with String, Food Chopper Vegetable Cutter for Veggies, Fruits, Salad, Onion, Ginger, Nut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cji09mrlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍅Chopping in A Breeze - The 3 blades of the vegetable chopper are distributed at different heights and directions for more efficient and evenly cutting, chopping in seconds. Just get the kitchen job done with several pulls, pulling the rope once equals at least 20 cuts with a knife. 1-5 times for roughly food in 5s, 6-10 for medium in 10s, 11-20 for fine and 20+ for extra fine and liquid purees. What's more, the scraper sweeps the ingredients off the lid while cutting, to help chop fully. 🥕 Features Your All Need - The chopper vetetable cutter with 2 cups is enough for your kitchen needs, also suitable for small amount of seasoniong. Meet your different needs including veggie such as onion, garlic, carrot, tomato, etc; fruits such as avocado, apple, etc; and other ingredients such as nut, ice and so on, to make recipes like salad, salsa, topping on pizza, smoothie and even baby food. Plus, you can get fast chopped onion without tears, no more smell on hands after cutting garlic. 🧅 Safety Material - Lid is made of ABS material and more sturdy. Solid nylon drawstring design for added abrasion resistance and quick rebound. Blades are made of surgical grade 420 stainless steel to ensure they will not bend or rust. The container and scraper are made of safety food grade material, suitable for dishwasher safety. The bottom also adds non-slip rubber strip design. Overall, all parts of the food chopper adopts baby food grade no BPA material, please rest assured to buy and use. 🧄 Tips for Operation - Fristly, the blade is extremely sharp, to avoid touching the blade directly by hand. Secondly, we suggest that do not pull the string to the end during use. Furthermore, the chopped food can be stored in container and keep seasoning fresh in the refrigerator. Lastly, the onion chopper can be easily washed by hand or in dishwasher. But pay attention to lid with string because water can enter during washing. Therefore, it is recommended to wipe the lid with a damp cloth. 🍄 Satisfaction Guaranteed - All purchasers of Geedel are covered by a 90-day quality guarantee. If you have any problems, either in terms of quality or usage, even if your return window is closed, please don't worry, just feel free to contact us via email or the contact seller button. The chopper also comes with a 365-day warranty. We offer 24 hours customers service and lifetime technical support. Your satisfaction is what we must first take into consideration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cji09mrlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Geedel","source_asin":"B08LZCRF9X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LZCRF9X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LZCRF9X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
