window.products.push({"id":663059,"name":"Hanging Brooch Pin Storage Organizer, Pin Wall Display Banner for Display Pins, Buttons and Lapel Collections, Brooch Pin Collection Storage Holder Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MO7Ye-HGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Large Capacity: Our hanging enamel pin wall display banner is super-sized and can hold up to 141 pins! With a size of 38 x 67 cm / 14.96 x 26.37 in and a weight of 270 g, it's perfect for organizing and displaying your brooch pins, enamel pins, lapel pins, badges, and buttons. (Pins not included) Unique Design: PACMAXI's pennant-style brooch pins display holder is designed to display your pin collection neatly and safely. Each felt slot is clean and tidy, and you can easily stick your pins into the \"felt covers\" for a clean and organized display. Durable Material: Made of high-quality double-sided felt material with nice stitching, our hanging brooch pin display flag organizer is durable and will last a long time. making it perfect for showing off your pins and brooches while saving space and easily storing them. Perfect Decoration: With a felt rope, our pins and brooches storage organizer can be hung on the wall as a beautiful and unique lapel enamel pins wall decoration. It's perfect for adding warmth and interest to your house, living room, office, and other living spaces! Excellent Gift: Our hanging enamel pin wall display banner is a perfect gift for family members, men, husbands, boys, friends, brothers, teens, kids, children, and pin collectors. They will love it, and it's also a great idea for wall decoration!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MO7Ye-HGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PACMAXI","source_asin":"B09QXM46FV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QXM46FV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QXM46FV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":663060,"name":"JoyJolt Faye Crystal Whiskey Glasses. Lowball Glasses Set of 6, 10oz Hand Made Short Glass Tumbler with Heavy Base. Double Old Fashioned Rocks Glass f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91A18gV8ygL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A TOAST TO Faye! Bourbon whiskey tumblers, scotch glasses, gin glasses, tequila or juice glasses – whatever you have in mind for your Nova drinking glass, Nova has in mind for you! A simple glass for home, but with the same heft and hand-feel that astute whiskey drinkers appreciate at a bar. A HEFTY GLASS WITH SOLID BASE: With its 3.14” grip, 1.8mm rolled rim and thick base, Nova Rocks Glasses are elegant, robust and the perfect bar glasses due to their 10oz capacity and 10oz heft. But if you also need short tumblers & water glasses or kitchen glasses, Nova is strong for daily use! LEAD FREE, CRYSTAL DRINK GLASSES: Notice how shiny and luxurious these 10oz small glasses look! That’s because the Nova whiskey glass set is handmade crystal and therefore free from bubbles and imperfections. Notice also, the subtle tapered base on these mixed drinks glasses, it’s unique to Faye. DISHWASHER SAFE GLASS CUPS SET: Please always use the glassware section of your dishwasher, because these tumbler glasses have such a hefty base like all good DoF glasses should, they may flip upside down in other parts of your dishwasher. Remember to polish off water spots for a crystal shine! DRINK FOR JOY! Just like every Joy Jolt glass set, our lowball glass sets will arrive bubble wrapped and securely gift boxed, with our robust 12-Month Warranty. So if you’re looking for nice, classic glass drinking glasses that you could use on occasion or everyday - Drink for Joy with Nova and JoyJolt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91A18gV8ygL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JoyJolt","source_asin":"B0C3HSX9Q5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3HSX9Q5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3HSX9Q5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
