window.products.push({"id":663094,"name":"Sauder Original Cottage Desk, Cobblestone Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EGB8T5wzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whimsical without being fussy, the Original Cottage Desk offers a vibrant pop of color to any room. Available in a mix and match color palette you can create a whole room cottage decor. Clean lines are complimented by deeply faceted drawer fronts and solid wooden knobs, craftsman like details that speak to the authentic origins of this collection. Whether your need is matchy matchy, mix and match, or unique room accent, Original Cottage in three colors - Cobblestone, Melon Yellow and Rainwater - is a modern classic that will add eye appeal to any home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EGB8T5wzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sauder","source_asin":"B00D84PPMS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D84PPMS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D84PPMS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":663095,"name":"Aurio Christmas Lights Multicolor, 12.3ft 25-Count LED End-to-End Connectable C9 Christmas String Lights, Light Strings for Party, Wedding, Indoor & O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31SnXnKUpNL._AC_.jpg","description":"Aurio Lighting proudly presents the Longlife line of LED Light Strings. This represents Aurio’s commitment to innovate and create products with premium features at affordable price points. Featuring our patented Twin-Power LED, which uses 2 chips per bulb, the lights continue function even in the event of a short or open circuit, greatly increasing the life of the product. An 80% reduction in energy use saves on electricity bills and helps save the planet. Having CSAus Certification gives customers a peace of mind. All Aurio Longlife LED light strings are backed with a 3-Year Seasonal .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31SnXnKUpNL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aurio","source_asin":"B0842R667G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0842R667G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0842R667G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":663096,"name":"Farmhouse Pig Bathroom Wall Art Funny Pig Bathroom Pictures Wall Decor Rustic Pig Canvas Painting Prints Artwork for Wall Country Black And White Anim","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MnArh1YFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introduction:  * It is canvas prints, not hand-painted painting,there is not difference in the product itself,but colors may appear slightly different to each user due to individual monitors.* each panel of canvas print already stretched on solid wooden frames,And comes with hook attached, put into solid master carton for shipping.* canvas print printed at hi-res on quality thick artist premium canvas with extra mirrored border.* The solid wood mounted canvas prints is stylish, attractive and suitable for any contemporary, modern, vintage or retro decor indoor wall art.Benefits:This art work comes already framed ready to hang, each panel has a wide hook already attached for easy hanging.If the product has damaged during delivery,you can contact us to return refund or change a new one.Fast shipping, risk free for purchase, 30 days money back guarantee of reciept of shipment.Perfect Gift Idea:For wedding, anniversary, thanksgiving, christmas, mother's Day, father's Day, valentine, birthday and others.Please note display pictures are only for illustration purposes.They were not taken in real display rooms and do not represent the real size of the set.Please measure your wall properly and make sure you pick the right size.Great Inspirational Art for Wall Decor:Perfect choice for wall decor such as living room, bedroom, guest room, bathroom, kitchen, dinning room, meeting room, hallway, nurseries, coffee house, condo house, hotels, inn, Spa, Lounge, Sauna and other spaces of home, family, office, business, reflection and relaxation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MnArh1YFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SweetFox","source_asin":"B09YYMR6VH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YYMR6VH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YYMR6VH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":663097,"name":"Bed Pillows for Sleeping Queen Size Set of 2 Shredded Memory Foam Pillows Comfortable Pillows Adjustable Supportive Pillows for Side Stomach Back Slee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iR++8-kYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INNOVATIVE MEMORY FOAM PILLOWS: The bed Pillow is filled with 85% high quality memory gel foam and 15% microfiber wadding. The shredded memory foam pillow is supportive and comfortable for sleeping, a wonderful balance between firmness and softness. Its foam filling with high density provides you maximum support at all angles. It is suitable for any back, side or stomach sleepers to use. The supportive pillow helps sleeper feel refreshed and energized when they wake up. PREMIUM BED PILLOWS: The pillow cover is made of superior rayon. It is skin-friendly, breathable, hypoallergenic and soft to touch. Our pillows pass OEKO-TEX Standard 100 certified, which guarantees the product quality, safety and health and meets environmental standards. It provides you outstanding comfort quality and safety. MOROCCAN COVER: The pillow cover adopts 3-layers thicken fabric to make the cover more fluffy and softer to touch. The outer fabric is quilted with exquisite Moroccan pattern and each side of the pillow is designed with mesh fabric to keep breathability. Our luxury pillows are a great way to upgrade your bedroom. You can enjoy the comfortable experience of a five-star hotel at home every night. ADJUSTABLE HEIGHT & SUPPORT: You can easily adjust pillow to your comfortable height level and shape as you like. There is a zipper on the side of bed pillow. You can open it and remove fillings through it to adjust the height of the pillow. The gel pillow provides personalized support to your head, neck and shoulders, to relieve pain and improve your sleeping quality. FLUFFY & USE: The 2 pack bed pillows are compressed packaged. You will receive 2 pillow covers and 2 pillow inserts when you open the package. Please put the insert into the cover first and then pat them fully to restore its shape and wait 24 hours before using the pillows for sleeping. The high-quality shredded memory foam filling has good resilience and strength. It keeps the pillow in shape and the pillow will never go flat. SIZE & CARE: The Bed pillows are available in 3 sizes as follows: Standard: 20 x 26 inches; Queen: 20 x 30 inches; King 20 x 36 inches. Only the pillow covers are machine washable in cold water; Tumble dry with low heat. RESPONSIVE CUSTOMER SERVICE: Customers’ satisfaction is important to us. We are confident to our products. We believe you will like our products and service. If you are not satisfied with your purchase, we offer you a 30-day full refund policy and if you have any problem, please contact us immediately. We will help you solve it as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iR++8-kYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr.Ye","source_asin":"B0BYZ4DQ71","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663097","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYZ4DQ71","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYZ4DQ71","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
