window.products.push({"id":663100,"name":"PolSurdy Black Shark Wine Glass Set of 2 for Shark Lover Gifts, Goblet Wine Cocktail Juice Glass for Housewarming, Wedding, Kitchen Bar Celebration (1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616FhiVvt4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1. Package including: Two high-quality exquisite wine glasses with packaging boxes. Color: Transparent, Theme: Shark. 2. Lead-free glass: Ordinary wine glass are only produced at around 1,400 degrees Celsius, and the lead in the raw materials cannot be removed. We know that the boiling point of lead is 1740 degrees Celsius. We use high temperatures of 1800 to 2000 degrees Celsius to obtain pure liquid silicon. 3. Mechanical molding: Ordinary manual blowing and drawing of glass due to the difference in production conditions and the level of workers, the quality of the glass produced is difficult to maintain the same. We use molds to pour the sharks and use centrifugal pouring until the glass is completely cooled. This process avoids drastic temperature changes and shape changes, which greatly increases the life and stability of the red wine glass. 4. Exquisite gift packaging: We use customized exquisite gift boxes with built-in fully-fitting foam packaging. You don't have to worry about it having problems during transportation. It is very suitable as a birthday gift for shark lovers and decoration for families living by the sea. Of course, this exquisite and unique wine glass is suitable for all kinds of romantic gatherings of couples and friends. 5. Rest assured to buy: We are committed to providing satisfactory service. If there is any dissatisfaction within 90 days, we will try our best to give you a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616FhiVvt4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PolSurdy","source_asin":"B09LYWDV1P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LYWDV1P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LYWDV1P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
