window.products.push({"id":663103,"name":"Tgfer New 7' Large Ceramic Maneki Neko Lucky Cat Coin Bank Style Wealth Fan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jrpKwCeYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The Maneki Neko cat is well known as she can bring fortune for her owner. The pattern plays different meanings. This serial includes five styles. 1) Style Gold ingot : body with Chinese words \"四季发财\", means bringing good wealth at four seasons. 2) Style Style Fubao: body with Chinese words \"生意兴隆\", means the owner's business wil be booming. 3) Style Coin: body with Chinese words \"财源滚滚\", means bringing great wealth. 4) Style Treasure Ship: body with Chinese words \"一帆风顺\", means everthing is going well just like smooth sailing on the sea. 5) Style Wealth Fan: body with Chinese words \"金运招财\", means bringing good fortune and the wealth to the owner. Take her home, you also take love & friendship & wealth etc back to home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jrpKwCeYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tgfer","source_asin":"B07BW3RMXZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663103","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BW3RMXZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BW3RMXZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
