window.products.push({"id":663252,"name":"Oblivi Stainless Steel Tea Strainer, Tea Infusers For Loose Tea, Rose, Coffee, Spices, Long-Handle Tea Filter Stick Pipe Tea Diffuser, Tea Leaf Infuse","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vsyQ-icZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍃【FINE MESH TEA FILTER】Tiny holes prevent loose tea leaking from the infuser effectively. Say goodbye to debris in your tea. 🍃【HIGHT QUALITY】Made from high quality & food grade stainless steel 304, BPA free, non-toxic, stylish, reusable, durable and rust free, contains NO harmful chemicals. 🍃【PERFECT DESIGN】Compact & hooked design, a hook on the end that hooks onto the edge of your mug easily, perfect for hanging on teapots, mugs, cups to steep loose leaf tea and coffee, slim body allow large space for your tea, and can fit different cups or mug. 🍃【EASY TO USE】Just rotate and pull up the pipe to put the tea in, then put it in a cup or mug and brew for a while. 🍃【 MULTI-FUNCTION】The tea strainer can be used to add other herbs or spices to iced drinks. It is perfect for making a delicious iced tea, a refreshing hot tea in the morning, or a calming and soothing warm tea before going to bed. The tea strainer is suitable for office, family, business trip and travel tea set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vsyQ-icZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oblivi","source_asin":"B09MYRB5MD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MYRB5MD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MYRB5MD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":663253,"name":"Lenox Federal Platinum Fine Bone China 20-Piece Dinnerware Set, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4107NQVAA6L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description It's no wonder that Federal Platinum is the most popular Lenox china pattern¿ and the most popular china pattern in America today. In pristine bone china with double bands of precious platinum, this classic pattern will transform any table setting from ordinary to extraordinary. Each serving piece is distinguished by a footed stand, creating a beautiful presentation. With its platinum trim, the pattern is the perfect complement to Lenox flatware and platinum-banded stemware. Amazon.com The clean lines, fine bone china, and gleaming platinum accents of the Lenox Federal pattern create a beautifully dressed table appropriate for any season. Classically simple yet elegant, the white base of each piece is accented by three bands of platinum--the widest band at the rim and two narrower ones within it--and a shining glaze overall. The teacup's platinum accents are especially attractive; they encircle the foot and rim and trace the side edges of the handle. Each five-piece setting includes a 10-7/8-inch dinner plate, an 8-1/4-inch salad/dessert plate, a 6-3/8-inch bread and butter plate, a 6-inch saucer, and a 6-ounce footed teacup. The set is dishwasher-safe and covered by a lifetime replacement policy. Lenox also makes serveware, flatware, and accessory pieces in the Federal platinum pattern. --Emily Bedard Whats in the Box 4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: 10-7/8-inch dinner plate; 8-1/4-inch salad/dessert plate; 6-3/8-inch bread/butter plate; 6-ounce teacup; 6-inch-saucer. 20 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4107NQVAA6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lenox","source_asin":"B00006IZWZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00006IZWZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00006IZWZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
