window.products.push({"id":663397,"name":"UMEISIYI Kids Alarm Clock, 7 Color Nightlight, Snooze, Temperature Detect, for Toddler, Children Boys and Girls, Students to Wake up at Bedroom, Batte","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ePhZ2WG+S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UMEISIYI Kids Night Light Bedside Clock is design for Wake up sleepy children to avoid late for school.our Bedside Clock boasts dreamlike one tap-activated backlight.you can Check time in darkness without turning on the light.Soft light creates a fantastic atmosphere，make your child feel like being in a fairy tale world.help stay happy good mood when waked up in a dream. LED display& 2 Time modes and 2 Temperature modes: Normal time mode Display of time, date (2000-2099), week, temperature Snooze mode Can set the daily wake-up time and the duration of the snooze interval Natural sound recognition mode Freely selectable music and adjustable volume Temperature mode Conversion between Celsius and Fahrenheit, measuring range-indoor temperature: -25℃~50℃ (32℉~122℉) Backlight Tap the top lightly, the soft 7-color light will turn on, and tap it again to turn it off. Specifications: Net Weight: 140g Product Dimension: 85*85*80mm Ringtones: 8 Snooze Duration: 1-60minutes Display type:Digital Special Function :Luminous, Weekly Display, Perpetual Calendar, Decoration, Month Display, Thermometer, Calendar, 24 Hours Instructions Power Type:3*batteries AAA ,1.5V Shell material : plastic Color: white and blue circle Notice After alarm setting is done, remember to press UP or DOWN to turn on the alarm and snooze, otherwise the alarm will not sound at all. The alarm icon and snooze icon will appear on the display. .Sumanpplus LED children's alarm clock has no memory function. After closing, the time must be reset. .We will unconditionally provide any support for the purchase of Sumanplus alarm clock. Packing List 1x Digital Alarm Clock 1x User Manual3*AAA Battery","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ePhZ2WG+S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UMEISIYI","source_asin":"B09FM2P14S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663397","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FM2P14S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FM2P14S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
