window.products.push({"id":663457,"name":"Charged Gemstone Large Orgone Pyramid – Certified Orgonite® Healing Crystals and Copper Multicolor Bio–Energy Enhancing Tool by Beverly Oaks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1Hn2oI2M5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What is Orgonite? Orgone is a mixture of catalyzed fiberglass resin with metal shavings, particles or powders, poured into molds adhering to strict specifications. It is said to attract aetheric energy similarly to Reich's accumulators.  It is a substance which functions as a self-driven, continuously-operating, highly efficient energy transmutation device, drawing in negative life energy and transmuting it into positive energy. The resin inside shrinks during the curing process, permanently squeezing the quartz crystal inside which creates a well-known piezoelectric effect inside the crystal, meaning its end-points become polarized electrically, this causes it to function more effectively as a positive energy generator. What do our customers think? Don’t just take our word for how Orgone pyramids can help, take a look at our reviews and see what our customers are saying!  “This definitely brings some awesome energy to our home. I feel calm and peaceful when it is near. The colors are vibrant and the quality is great. It was packaged nicely and I know this came from a place with an intention of healing.” Carla R.  “This pyramid is gorgeous!! I got it to sit on my computer desk to repel / transmute EMFs and negative energies of any kind. It's gorgeous just to look at and it measures 2-7/8\" at the base and is ~ 2.5\" tall. Well worth the price, well made, happy that it is Reiki-charged, as well, just makes it more powerful. I would buy again, for sure. Love it!” DL Maher  “Wonderful. It's beautiful. I can feel its energy. Keeps the grumpy bf calm and collected. I have started hearing and seeing many birds around my house. Something that has never happened before.” Ruben A.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1Hn2oI2M5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beverly Oaks","source_asin":"B06Y5Y5WBH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663457","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y5Y5WBH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y5Y5WBH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
