window.products.push({"id":663477,"name":"Pig In Tub Lolly Chocolate Candy Mold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ylpsQA-kL._AC_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ylpsQA-kL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EBIMVY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663477","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EBIMVY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EBIMVY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":663478,"name":"Vintage 1949 Stemmed Wine Glass with Charm and Presentation Packaging","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41B5wfCAcXS._AC_.jpg","description":"Your glass is engraved with Vintage 1949 in a beautiful wreath desgin. It is embellished with a fun and decorative wine charm and arrives in beautiful presentation packaging that is ready for gift giving. The engraving is done with a laser which creates micro fissures in the glass. These micro fissures create a frosted effect that is permanent and dishwasher safe. It wont fade and wont be washed away, chipped, or scratched like other brands. The eye-catching presentation packaging is hand-assembled from wood and ribbon and is a refreshing change to the flimsy plastic that many manufacturers ship in from overseas. If you are giving this glass as a gift, your recipient will appreciate all the fine details. From the beautiful packaging to the fun wine charm to the permanent engraving this gorgeous Vintage 1949 wine glass is a gift that will be treasured. It is perfect for any occasion including anniversaries, birthdays, housewarmings, engagements, bachelorette parties, graduations, friendship celebrations, secret santa and white elephant exchange, the holiday office party & more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41B5wfCAcXS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Orange Kat","source_asin":"B07MLG74Q4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663478","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MLG74Q4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MLG74Q4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
