window.products.push({"id":663521,"name":"Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, 50PCS Non-Stick Parchment Paper Liners, with Disposable Gloves, Round Cooking Paper, Oil-proof, Water-Proof for Air ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81waqPh4c3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Non-Stick Air Fryer Round Parchment Paper Liners-Makes Your Life Easy  Everyone knows that the air fryer is delicious and easy to use, but using the air fryer directly will make it greasy and difficult to clean.  Our baking paper is made of silicone oil paper, which is waterproof, oil-proof, and non-stick bottom, which greatly saves our cleaning time.  These non-stick disposable air fryer liners are designed with a round bowl shape, which does not need to tear, fold, cut, or bend, and you can directly put it in when you are ready to cook. Its heightened edge of 4.5cm can protect the side of fryers and prevent food from sticking to them. Healthy & Natural The parchment paper is made of natural wood pulp, safe and non-toxic. No need to worry it will contaminate food. And it can withstand temperatures up to 428°F, which can meet most recipes requirements. Extra Thickened Our parchment is 45gsm, durable and not easy to break. Easy to help you keep any food looking perfect. Wide Application Suitable for the air fryer, microwave oven, oven, steamer, cooking utensils, etc. The paper lining can be used for baking, grilling, frying, or holding food, suitable for home baking, camping, barbecue, summer parties, etc. Easy to Clean Don't let dirt and chaos get in your mood and prevent you from baking! Use the disposable paper lining of the air fryer to start a cleaner kitchen life!  These disposable paper pads can effectively keep food residue away from the fryer, making it as clean as it has not been used, saving time and effort. If you hate cleaning after baking, you must use these paper liners. Notes In order to avoid burning in air fryer please don't put air fryer liner at the preheating time.Parchment paper for air fryer cannot be used directly on the open flame or directly on the charcoal grill.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81waqPh4c3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LM BODYCARE","source_asin":"B09TZL6TN6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663521","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TZL6TN6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TZL6TN6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
