window.products.push({"id":663609,"name":"Sijo Lightweight and Cooling Comforter, 100% Eucalyptus Lyocell Shell and Fill, Best Airflow Comforter Award Winner by Sleep Foundation, Super Breatha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":235.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GTbB0esaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Most Comfortable Comforter Ever Invented: Awarded as \"Best Airflow Comforter of 2022\" by Sleep Foundation. Ideal for sleepers who overheat easily under blankets and comforters. 100% Eucalyptus Lyocell inside out: Both the shell and fill of this comforter are made with 100% eucalyptus lyocell fibers from Austrian forests to maximize its breathability and durability. The shell is cool and soft to the touch, its sateen weave creates a luxuriously smooth and silky feel that is ideal for people with acne, rashes, and other conditions that cause sensitive skin. The fill is also made with 100% Eucalyptus lyocell fiber. It is naturally moisture-wicking, making the comforter an excellent choice for sleepers who sweat at night and those living in warm or humid climates. It has a lightweight yet fluffy feel that’s perfect for sleepers who want to stay both cool and cozy. 8 Loops on all corners and sides: To prevent shifting and bunching, the comforter features eight loops to secure it to the duvet cover – one on each corner, and one on each side. A perfect match to pair the comforter with Sijo eucalyptus duvet covers. Dry cleaning recommended to preserve the lifespan of this comforter and maintain an even distribution of fill.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GTbB0esaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sijo","source_asin":"B0B42JYCVL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663609","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B42JYCVL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B42JYCVL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":663610,"name":"Coffee Bar Cabinet with Glass Holder,Wine Rack Freestanding Floor,Wine Rack Table with Mug Rack and Bottle Holder, Floor Liquor Wine Cabinet Storage, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717NGJRY+tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large Capacity Wine Cabinet】 The wine rack table features 2 large lower shelves and 1 upper hutch,1 tier stand hold for wine glass or mug. There is extra bottle shelf with two shapes of inserted wine compartments, square-shaped for standard wine bottles (750ml) or beer bottles, and X-shaped for large wine bottles.All-in-one Design kitchen rack combines a wine glass or cup holder, wine rack, and storage shelves, kitchen bakers' rack, which provides a large capacity to organize kitchen essentials. Overall size: 29.5\" L x 19\" D x 65\" H. 【Modern Elegant Design Wine Bar Cabinet】The stylish style display wine rack matched your furniture perfectly, ideal for use in the living room, kitchen, wine cellar,dinner party, bar cabinet or cocktail hour. The home kitchen shelf not only can hold your favorite wine,beer or liquor ,but also allows you to display your pretty wine glasses. Compact storage of wine, pretty enough to show guests. Compact design yet vintage appearance makes this freestanding wine rack easily blend into any style of home decor,you will love how it adds pizzazz to your apartment! 【Wine Rack with Stable & Durable Structure】This wine rack cabinet constructed of high-quality MDF and reinforced matte black metal, the heavy-duty floor wine rack is built to last, can bear up to 120lbs. Adjustable foot pads enhance the standing kitchen rack sturdy and can stop from wobbling even on uneven floors. 【Practical Small Accessories】This kitchen wine table rack comes with 6 extra S shaped hooks,which allows you freely to hang kitchen mitts or other utensils. The wine storage cabinet also comes with wine cork holder basket,essential small accessories in wine rack. 【Easy Assembly & Free Service】This wine display shelves is simple to be assembled by the detailed instructions. Well labeled parts and hardware, necessary tools and clear instruction are all included in the package for quickly installation.We offer lifetime professional customer service. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717NGJRY+tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOOKZON","source_asin":"B08H4YKXH9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663610","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H4YKXH9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H4YKXH9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
