window.products.push({"id":663668,"name":"ArtistZila Soap Dish Natural Marble Bathroom Accessory Reversible Soapdish Handmade Beautiful Jali Soap Tray Shower Soap Saver Sponges, Scrubber Bath ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aPkRjuJKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A bathroom soap dish is a truly essential bathroom accessory that helps to keep the sink, shower and tub tidy and free of soap residue while allowing bar soaps to last for as long as possible. Although soap dishes serve an important function, they can also add style to the decor of a bathroom, provided you choose something unique and attractive. The Handmade Indian Stone Soap Dish is sure to bring that special finishing touch to your bathroom with its beautiful materials and meticulous hand craftsmanship.Stone Soap Dish has a simple oval shape that allows one to fully appreciate the stunning natural patterning of the natural stone used to construct it. Each piece of earth toned stone is hand selected to ensure that only the most attractive and flawless raw materials go into the production of each soap dish. At 4.5 inches in length by 3.5 inches in width by 1.5 inch in height, the soap dish can hold any standard soap bar, and it has three holes that allow water to drain off of the soap after use to keep it from becoming soft. Although all soap dishes are from same family of stone,each soapdish will varies in color and fragments and will differ from the one shown above.Often Soapdishes carved out from the same roots too vary in color hues and patterns. Handmade by the stone artisans of Agra, India. Shaping the finest quality stone by hand using chisels, files and other simple hand tools.The Soap Dish is a unique gift idea that can be given on its own or with a luxurious bar soap or bath gift basket. Often, the soap dish is used as a housewarming gift or as a hostess gift due to its association with household decor. Order the Handmade Indian Stone Soap Dish today. Although all bathroom soap dishes are from the same family of stone,each soap dish will varies in color and fragments and will differ from the one shown above.Often Soap dishes carved out from the same rock too vary in color hues and patterns. Possible variations are shown in the last image above.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aPkRjuJKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtistZila","source_asin":"B07L3QT4H3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L3QT4H3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L3QT4H3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
