window.products.push({"id":663731,"name":"Toothbrush Holders 3 Cups Toothbrush Holder Wall Mounted with Automatic Toothpaste Dispenser, Electric Tooth Brushing Holder with 6 Toothbrush Slots,1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kQ2NEUs1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multi-functional Toothbrush Holders for Bathrooms: Toothbrush holder contains 1 automatic toothpaste dispenser for home use, 3 brush cups, 6 toothbrush slots, 2 drawers, and 4 hooks. Multi-functional incorporation rack, a set of products solves the problem of incorporating toiletries for the family. Easy to install. No holes to punch or drill. The wall mount toothbrush holder comes with a non-marking sticker and suction wall hanging to protect the wall without leaving a mark and save your bathroom space.Simply clean the wall and press the adhesive strip to fully bond to the wall for 12 hours, then you can hang the toothbrush holder.Bathroom toothbrush holder set can hold up to 11 pounds without coming off. Large Capacity Tooth Brush Holder: Toothbrush holder bathroom organizer has superb storage capacity to keep your bathroom clean and tidy.The top tray can neatly hold cosmetics and bathroom accessories,and the hidden drawer can store lipstick.This bathroom decor will beautify your new home or apartment. These smart home products are a must-have for the bathroom in your home. Durable: Tooth pastetooth paste holder uses non-marking adhesive strips that provide excellent caulking.Whether it's metal, wood, mirror, tile or marble, it's durable when used on smooth, flat, wave-free surfaces. The longer it bears, the tighter the adhesion. Easy to use: These beautiful mouthwash cups come in 3 different colors for each person to choose from, making it easy to distinguish. It is suitable for all toothpaste with hole diameter less than 0.47 inch. You can quickly get the length of toothpaste you want by changing the strength. The toothbrush holder and toothpaste dispenser bathroom set can be disassembled and cleaned directly with water. It is a very decent gift for parents and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kQ2NEUs1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QKTYB","source_asin":"B0BRSSW9T6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663731","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRSSW9T6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRSSW9T6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
