window.products.push({"id":663819,"name":"Crucial Vacuum Shark Navigator Lift-Away Filter Kit with 1 HEPA Filter, 1 Foam Filter and 1 Felt Pre-Filter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DHoJG4r1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High quality replacement Shark Navigator Lift-Away filter kit designed to fit Shark NV350 NV351, NV352, NV355, NV356, NV356E, NV357 UV440. This kit Includes 1 Hepa Filter that compared to Shark part # XHF350 & 1 Foam Filter and 1 Felt Pre-Filter that compared to Shark part # XFF350 & XFF350NZ. Read More Looking for Replacement Shark Lift Away Filters? Shark makes great vacuum cleaners. When working correctly, homeowners can glide the machines across their floors and carpets with ease. And boy do those surfaces get clean. But over time — particularly when put through repeated use in challenging environments — you might notice your Shark vacuum cleaner begin to lose its sucking power. When that happens, you’ll end up spending a lot of time dragging your vacuum cleaner over your floors, essentially moving dirt from one corner to another. Does that sound like a good use of time? Believe it or not, it’s recommended that you replace your vacuum cleaner’s filters every three months, assuming, of course, you want to keep your floors spotless. If you haven’t changed your filters in some time — and especially if you’ve never changed them — it might be time to swap them out. Crucial Vacuum: Your One-stop Shop for All Cleaning Needs! If you’re looking for Shark Lift Away filters, you’ve come to the right place. Whereas many brand-name manufacturers outsource the production of their replacement parts to third parties, we at Crucial Vacuum design and build our generic replacement filters in our own facilities. And instead of choosing to sell our products in brick-and-mortar stores, we ship them directly to you via the Internet. Our modernized supply chain allows us to reduce our costs significantly, and those savings are reflected in our price tags. In addition to low costs, we also offer to all U.S. addresses, so you stand to save even more. This replacement kit — which features a HEPA filter, a foam filter and a felt filter —","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DHoJG4r1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crucial Vacuum","source_asin":"B00AN9JRSO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663819","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AN9JRSO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AN9JRSO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
