window.products.push({"id":663904,"name":"Tovolo Scoop & Sift, Ergonomic Fine Mesh Sieve Flour Sifter, Easy Scoop 1 Measuring Cup, Dishwasher-Safe Baking Tool for Dusting & Aerating, Charcoal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Khj+36wUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Let us eat cake! The multipurpose 1 Cup Scoop & Sift from Tovolo removes lumps and aerates flour to be effortlessly incorporated into batters. Level off your dry ingredients for a perfect 1-cup measurement of powdered sugar, flour, spice, or another dry ingredient. Hold the sieve over your mixing bowl or baked good, and tap the edge gently to disperse the ingredients. 1 cup capacity makes it easy to measure and sift ingredients easily. Level off your flour, cocoa, or confectioner’s sugar, then sift them over your mixing bowl for perfectly aerated and lump-free dry ingredients and batters. Every baker needs a fine mesh sieve for sifting, dusting and straining. This small sieve is the perfect size for sifting small amounts of dry ingredients, dusting baked goods with powdered sugar or straining ingredients like ricotta. Designed for easy scooping, the Scoop & Sift features a shovel-shaped front and thick lip to avoid spills. The comfortable handle makes it easy to go from measuring ingredients to holding the sieve over the mixing bowl. With a 1 cup capacity, go from the flour tin into your mixing bowl with just a scoop and level. Also great for dusting with confectioners’ sugar and cocoa powder. Made of BPA-free nylon and stainless steel wire. Dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Khj+36wUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovolo","source_asin":"B0B52ZX12V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663904","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B52ZX12V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B52ZX12V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
