window.products.push({"id":663928,"name":"bathivy Soup Maker Automatical Soup Cooker Multifunctional Soup and Smoothie Make Machine | 1.6 Liters, 6 Functions, Stainless Steel | Smooth, Chunky,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61agIt7kIEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【6 In 1 Multifunction, More than a Soup Maker】Soup maker is designed to make fresh and healthy homemade soups in as little as 28 minutes. It's equipped with a powerful motor and strong stainless steel blades that can easily handle a variety of ingredients, from fibrous vegetables to tough cuts of meat. More than just soup. 6 preset programs for making pureed soup, chunky soup, smoothies, vegetable juices, compote, baby Purées, sauces and more according to your taste preferences. 【1.6 L Extra Large Capacity, Makes 2-5 servings】Professional soup maker is made with high-quality materials and innovative technology, easy to create delicious and healthy soups, stews, and purees with minimal effort. With its generous 1.6L large capacity, you can easily make enough soup to feed your family or meal prep for the week ahead. Soup maker is perfect for those who love to meal prep, and its versatile design allows you to also create smoothies, sauces, and purees with minimal effort. 【One-touch Automatic Program, Easy Operate】User-friendly interface makes it easy to choose your desired settings, whether you prefer smooth or chunky soups. Automatic program takes the guesswork out of soup-making, ensuring that each soup is cooked to perfection. Simply add the ingredients, press the mode button to select the program, and the machine will automatically heat and blend. The intuitive controls make it simple to create soups that are delicious and nutritious. 【Strong Stainless Steel Blades, Smooth Blending】2 powerful stainless steel blades with serrated teeth ensure easy extraction of nutrients. Blades are strong enough to blend and puree everything from chunky vegetables to thick meats. The quadrilateral stirring column that comes with the soup-making macahine mixes the ingredients thoroughly by causing them to repeatedly collide with each other. This ensures every ingredients is evenly blended, resulting in a soup with a consistently smooth taste. 【Make Fresh Soup, Maximum Maintain Nutrition】The all-in-one soup maker helps extract optimal nutrition and enjoy delicious homemade soup in just minutes! The built-in heating element and blending technology work together to break down your ingredients, releasing more vitamins and minerals into your soup than traditional cooking methods. Whether the fresh vegetables, fruits, lean meats, or whole grains, the soup maker helps to maintain the nutritional value of each ingredient.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61agIt7kIEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bathivy","source_asin":"B0BF5LTKPB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-663928","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF5LTKPB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF5LTKPB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
